#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Create a footer bar, fixed to the scroll, which contains menu items. The "
"goal is to provide a menu-level user experience similar to apps. The "
"configuration is very simple and the customization extensive without "
"programming knowledge."
msgstr ""
"Create a footer bar, fixed to the scroll, which contains menu items. The "
"goal is to provide a menu-level user experience similar to apps. The "
"configuration is very simple and the customization is extensive without "
"programming knowledge."

